## Context

Projects report bugs in the services they depend on (the harness, git-erg,
padme). Design note `design/2026-11-12-guichet-inter-repo-dialogue.md` (Status: provisional), § 5 and § 6, after a blind
triage trial on 27 real cross-project reports (`design/research/2026-11-12-guichet-triage-trial.md`: 19 no change, 3 small
or partial gains, 3 harms out of 25 judgeable): keep the status quo, in
which the asker files a ticket in the receiver's store, and add three
things. `rules/guards.md` stays unchanged. The rejected C1 design is in git
history at `72fed79`.

